receptor in human osteoblasts in vitro</article-title><source><italic>Endocrinology</italic></source><year>1991</year><volume>129</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>1513</fpage><lpage>1520</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1714833</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Roodman</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Perspectives: interleukin-6: an osteotropic factor?</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Bone and Mineral Research</italic></source><year>1992</year><volume>7</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>475</fpage><lpage>478</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1615755</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Canalis</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Marcus</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Skeletal growth factors</article-title><source><italic>Osteoporosis</italic></source><year>2008</year><edition>3rd edition</edition><publisher-loc>Burlington, Mass, USA</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Elsevier Academic Press</publisher-name><fpage>P529</fpage><lpage>P546</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Franchimon</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Durant</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Rydziel</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Canalis</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Platelet-derived growth factor induces interleukin-6 transcription in osteoblasts through the activator protein-1 complex and activating transcription factor-2</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Biological Chemistry</italic></source><year>1999</year><volume>274</volume><issue>10</issue><fpage>6783</fpage><lpage>6789</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10037779</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hanai</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Tokuda</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohta</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsushima-Nishiwaki</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Takai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kozawa</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase/Akt auto-regulates PDGF-BB-stimulated interleukin-6 synthesis in osteoblasts</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Cellular Biochemistry</italic></source><year>2006</year><volume>99</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>1564</fpage><lpage>1571</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16817229</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Takai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Tokuda</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanai</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Kozawa</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Limitation by p70 S6 kinase of platelet-derived growth factor-BB-induced interleukin 6 synthesis in osteoblast-like MC3T3-E1 cells</article-title><source><italic>Metabolism</italic></source><year>2007</year><volume>56</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>476</fpage><lpage>483</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17379004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kyriakis</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Avruch</surname><given-names>J</given-